  = note: the product is identically zero for these kinds (so it is not defined), or an operand is not a multivector of the same algebra and coefficient type (versor transport needs a declared versor kind as a value on the left)
  = note: a structured map (`map::LinearMap`, such as `PrincipalInertia`) takes part in products as its dense form, `.to_dense()`
  = help: `gax::pga3d::oriented::Point<S1, T, OA>` implements trait `Wedge<Rhs>`:
            Wedge<Plane<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Flector<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Motor<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Multivector<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Rotor<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Scalar<S2, T, OB>>
            Wedge<gax::pga3d::oriented::Translator<S2, T, OB>>
  = note: required for `gax::pga3d::oriented::Point<(), {float}>` to implement `BitXor`
